  "description": "Tamarin - The Urban Hustler\nMeet the Tamarin—your new go-to e-bike for conquering city streets with ease. Designed for seamless urban rides, the Tamarin features a robust 20” alloy frame paired with a powerful 48V 20Ah battery that delivers dependable power and performance. With its 250W motor, you can cruise effortlessly at speeds up to 20 MPH, making your daily commutes a breeze.\nThe front alloy fork with lock-out provides smooth handling over varying surfaces, while the hydraulic brake system ensures precise stopping power when you need it most. With a range of up to 50 miles on a single charge, you’ll have the freedom to explore more without constantly looking for a charging station.\nThe Tamarin is equipped with durable Kenda 20” x 4.5” tires that offer excellent traction and stability, and its comfortable saddle keeps you relaxed even on longer rides. Weighing in at 30 kg (66 lbs) with a maximum weight capacity of 120 kg (265 lbs), this bike is built to handle both the demands of urban commuting and the occasional adventure.\nFrom quick morning rides to navigating evening traffic, the Tamarin combines style, power, and reliability, giving you the edge to own the city streets like never before.",
